{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attention! Breaking news:</strong> the King of Sorcerers decided to \u201cmake a grand exit\u201d and left behind a crystal plague, hordes of monsters, and a mountain of trouble. Luckily, standing guard is\u2026 Eliz. A little witch, a bit of practice in offensive magic, a huge mess, and absolutely no plan B. Save this world before it\u2019s too late!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068550/extras/7def2aea197f4a831583ac0727eb0c90.poster.avif?t=1759501511\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068550/extras/7def2aea197f4a831583ac0727eb0c90.webm?t=1759501511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068550/extras/7def2aea197f4a831583ac0727eb0c90.mp4?t=1759501511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automatic shooting</strong> - focus on dodging, not button mashing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive difficulty</strong> - the longer you survive, the harder it gets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot and upgrades</strong> - collect items from chests, combine and enhance them, but beware of cursed ones!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spreading corruption</strong> - enemies grow stronger as the plague advances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic cleansin -</strong> you can purify the corruption, but it won\u2019t make your life easier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic map events</strong> - lasers, snakes, traps, and other delightful surprises to ruin your day.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >